{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2401,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": null,
  "name": "WTT Halloween Masks",
  "slug": "wtt-halloween-masks",
  "teaser": "Are you ready for some real masks?",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/JllE58676DHodxnJ7sfsJhepJfumLToI86NEvM1h.png",
  "downloads": 354,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Introduction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Yea so basically BSG’s halloween masks are for babies.</p>\n<p>IF YOU HAVE TRYPOPHOBIA, BLOOD MAKES YOU SQUEAMISH, HATE NEEDLES, OR MANY EYES BOTHER YOU DO NOT DOWNLOAD!</p>\n<p>Adds 10 Halloween masks available at Ragman level 2 for between 12k and 26k roubles.\nThey are also available on the flea.</p>\n<p>One of the masks is animated. If you want the animations to work, please download and install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2334/animator-enabler\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Animator Enabler</a></p>\n<p>There will be pictures in the Gallery.</p>\n<p>If you want to use “SPT Give” with commando to give yourself the masks here are the IDs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Many Eyes Mask - 68e05dbf4992827e7b000001</li>\n<li>3 Faces Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000001</li>\n<li>Fans Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000002</li>\n<li>Holes Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000003</li>\n<li>Crying Blood Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000004</li>\n<li>Spikes Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000005</li>\n<li>Ripped and Torn Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000006</li>\n<li>Stitches Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000007</li>\n<li>Burlap Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000008</li>\n<li>Hands Mask - 68e0c2c204f6dd0050000009</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install and Compatibility</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>How to install:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the latest version.</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file with your choice of archive manager (Like 7zip or WinRar, DO NOT USE BASE WINDOWS FILE MANAGER)</li>\n<li>Put the contents of the zip file into your SPT folder.</li>\n<li>Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Compatibility:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Most other content mods work with this, report any that don’t.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Incompatibility:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>If you are not using a patch for this mod with realism you will have many issues.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The standard way to troubleshoot this mod is as follows:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>If you have issues when you install this mod, try making a new profile (preferably a dev bear profile) and make sure your game works. I do this by standard with my mod prior to release anyways, so it should always work.</li>\n<li>Add your previously used mods and boot the game and run a raid after each installed mod. This is to see if anything is conflicting with my mod. Tell me what is conflicting and what your error message is so that I can verify whether it can be fixed or if it just needs to be added to incompatibilities.</li>\n<li>IF YOU HAVE “MISSING PACKAGE JSON” ERROR YOU INSTALLED IT WRONG</li>\n<li>If you are using something that is already listed as an incompatibility I am not going to help you.</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Image Gallery</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zhJVWHHR/Mask-Render-1.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-1\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7fQzH9x/Mask-Render-2.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-2\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fdyHJhRd/Mask-Render-3.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-3\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/273J9cw4/Mask-Render-4.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-4\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/N68SLpvd/Mask-Render-5.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-5\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rGKBZ508/Mask-Render-6.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-6\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zWFjqnHV/Mask-Render-7.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-7\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4nn8PxmQ/Mask-Render-8.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-8\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KjPQbnvw/Mask-Render-9.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-9\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GfVPLq5s/Mask-Render-10.png\" alt=\"Mask-Render-10\" /></p>\n<p>Support me on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/epicrangetime\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ko-Fi</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Many thanks to GrooveypenguinX who provided the codebase.</p>\n<p>Thank you to Tron for being a constant resource in brainstorming and troubleshooting as I continue to grow.</p>\n<p>Moxopixel for being a wealth of knowledge in the texturing department, I could not have done half of this without seeing what you’ve done.</p>\n<p>Thank you SSH for providing an SDK to streamline the process of creating items.</p>\n<p>Credit to ZectorLab for the great models and textures.</p>\n<p>Many thanks to my Ko-Fi supporters for the help:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Bloo</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ehtacs</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Nazlug</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>TwistedTeddy36</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Check out the WTT server <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/hKRbR6yvf2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.  </a></p>\n<p>Support me on Ko-Fi <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/epicrangetime\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
